  PackTracker brand + theme colours.
  Ramps are the literal source of truth and mirror assets/css/ybt-tokens.css
  (see BRAND-TOKENS.md). Roles below may reference a ramp entry; values-night/
  colours.xml overrides the roles only, so ramp literals never change.
-->
